he darkness returns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What could possibly be the cause?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And will Rem ever be free of these recurring nightmares?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/cb7d4b1ce6ab6b84227b4a8533cefdbe.poster.avif?t=1783930176\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/cb7d4b1ce6ab6b84227b4a8533cefdbe.webm?t=1783930176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/cb7d4b1ce6ab6b84227b4a8533cefdbe.mp4?t=1783930176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>■ NeverAwake FLASHBACK Features:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an eccentric, bizarre world set in the nightmares of a young girl.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeously hand-drawn graphics and animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unique progression through randomized stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced gameplay and high-stakes boss battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 90 stages and dozens of tricky bosses to overcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast array of weapons and accessories to create your preferred builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed with tons of added features not present in the original NeverAwake.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/dd529f018e6576e98fbd3969739cdcc0.avif?t=1783930176\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras_big/dd529f018e6576e98fbd3969739cdcc0.avif?t=1783930176 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>■ About the original NeverAwake:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NeverAwake is a nightmare shooter bursting with unique world-building and original gameplay rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rem fights against the things she dislikes: vegetables, dogs, school friends, and more. What awaits her at the end of her battles...? Will she ever be able to wake up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NeverAwake has received critical acclaim, including the top prize Vermillion Gate Award at BitSummit X-Roads (2022) and the Famitsu Gold Award, alongside a high Metascore. </p>", "short_description": "The side story to the nightmare shooter NeverAwake is here! Why is this young girl being tormented by nightmares once again? Dive into a roguelite reimagination of the original with all-new features!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/0f042fd0a333ffe2568973b720595aac66252cdf/header.jpg?t=1783930176", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/a6107026ac942c2c8fc02638ed5e1a84d3447f4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783930176", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/a6107026ac942c2c8fc02638ed5e1a84d3447f4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783930176", "website": "https://neverawake.neotro.jp", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> WIndows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8565U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<st